ub.com/az9713/grokbot-game-dev-demo","Scenes, puzzle rules, levels, art, audio helpers, and development documentation.",[228],{"_66":229,"_33":230,"_111":231},"Download and run Gravity Birds","https://github.com/az9713/grokbot-game-dev-demo#opening-in-godot-4","Download the repository, import project.godot in Godot 4.3+, then press F5. A working browser export is not supplied.","Local setup",[234],{"_66":235,"_33":236,"_111":-7},"Read the development journey","https://az9713.github.io/grokbot-game-dev-demo/gravity-birds-dev-journey.html",[238,239,240],"Import the project into Godot and play a level using movement, undo, and restart.","Read the development journey from cloud agent to a locally playable project.","Compare the documented movement and level-solvability fixes with the game code.","The creator documents Grok Bot assistants planning and directing a Cursor Cloud Agent, followed by local playtesting, gameplay fixes, and a later art and audio pass.","Godot 4.3 · GDScript",[238,239,240],{"_66":235,"_33":236,"_25":175},{"_66":229,"_33":230,"_25":122,"_111":231},{"_66":224,"_33":225,"_111":226,"_173":174},{"_66":219,"_33":220,"_111":221},[172,249],"godot-command-line","example:dunkirk-ai-assisted","dunkirk-ai-assisted","Dunkirk: an honestly documented AI-assisted shooter","A WWII-inspired vertical arcade shooter with a public Godot project and a precise breakdown of AI and manual contributions.","/examples/dunkirk-ai-assisted/",{"_27":251,"_29":252,"_31":253,"_161":324,"_157":163,"_153":164,"_149":323,"_9":325,"_134":326,"_123":327,"_40":328,"_107":329,"_98":330,"_303":331},[257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276],{"_62":29,"_75":252,"_64":29,"_99":-7},{"_62":162,"_75":253,"_64":31,"_99":-7},{"_62":72,"_66":159,"_75":324,"_64":161,"_99":150},{"_62":72,"_66":155,"_75":156,"_64":157,"_99":158},{"_62":72,"_66":151,"_75":152,"_64":153,"_99":154},{"_62":72,"_66":147,"_75":323,"_64":149,"_99":150},{"_62":91,"_66":140,"_141":142